Tolonglah saya, tuan puteri.

15:05.770 --> 15:07.080
Tolonglah saya, tuan puteri.

15:07.080 --> 15:07.750
Cepat.

15:07.780 --> 15:09.260
Cepat tolong saya, tuan puteri.

15:09.260 --> 15:10.800
Cepat tolong saya, tuan puteri.

15:10.800 --> 15:11.730
Tolonglah saya.

